  m_text: "\u2022 The AI does not remember previous messages or chat history.\n\n\u2022
    Response times may vary depending on your computer hardware.\n\n\u2022 AI suggestions
    may occasionally be inaccurate or misunderstand layouts.\n\n\u2022 Responses
    should be treated as guidance, not perfect solutions.\n\n\u2022 The system is
    still a work in progress and may contain bugs or unfinished features.\n\n\u2022
    More detailed prompts usually produce better AI responses.\n\n\u2022 Extremely
    complex layouts may reduce response quality."
